  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Heat the butter and olive oil in a 2-quart Dutch oven or clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the knead and cook until lightly browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the paprika, cumin, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the chicken broth and water, and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cover the pot with a tight-fitting lid.",
    "Bake for 20 minutes, then remove the lid and continue baking for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro before serving.",
    "Serve hot, straight from the pot.",
    "Let the tagine rest for 5 minutes before slicing and serving.",
    "Slice the tagine into thick wedges and serve immediately."
  ],
